    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kotama&amp;Academy\u00a0Citadel</i></strong> is a 3D Metroidvania game where players embody a mysterious yet charming girl to explore\u00a0the labyrinthine \u201cCarmel Academy Citadel\u201d. Embark on a witty, vibrant, and adrenaline-fueled journey to claim the title of [Carmel Star].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/5760a9bd77dd1ce12c19b3afddb288f4.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/757bdcec9e7b31b373e17c40d24d222c.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Carmel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An academy celebrated as the pinnacle of cutting-edge science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; reigns supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Carmel Star], a symbol of ultimate prestige, is the dream every student covets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the centennial celebration approaches, a new [Carmel Star Election] is set to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kotama, an mysterious\u00a0&quot;exchange student&quot; who emerges from obscurity, decides to join the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An academy cloistered from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crises lurking in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did it all begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is worthy of the crown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/17e4de6e5d0693126ff4425c4f28900e.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=339 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/b65db6f6bc652dceff5069df22312ca4.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2460 Explore the Enclosed Citadel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse\u00a0and witness\u00a0the Academy\u2019s surreal blend of reality and sci-fi landscapes. Harness Kotama\u2019s fluid-based abilities to overcome obstacles, evade traps. Collect items, weapons, and upgrades\u00a0to grow stronger, unlock new skills, find your way to ascend\u00a0and\u00a0become [The Carmel Star]. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/3ac36b70ff1603aeb51fbe1f591ddd87.poster.avif?t=1755498814\" width=640 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/3ac36b70ff1603aeb51fbe1f591ddd87.webm?t=1755498814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/3ac36b70ff1603aeb51fbe1f591ddd87.mp4?t=1755498814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2461 Thrilling Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this campus ruled by survival of the fittest, strength is your currency. Battle dozens of bizarre foes and rival powerful contenders with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/b6cbf76af401b81154059ff9ebf746a6.poster.avif?t=1755498814\" width=640 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/b6cbf76af401b81154059ff9ebf746a6.webm?t=1755498814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/b6cbf76af401b81154059ff9ebf746a6.mp4?t=1755498814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Precision Parries: Break enemy poise and dominate the flow of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Fluid Detonation: Trigger explosive reversals to turn defense into offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Bullet Time: Shatter enemies in split-second windows of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Dynamic Arsenal: Switch weapons at will, each with unique skills and combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Custom Builds: Select\u00a0chip runes\u00a0to\u00a0buff\u00a0up your ultimate battle strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2462 Rescue Lovely\u00a0Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet peculiar, captivating students scattered across the citadel. Aid them during your journey, uncover their stories, and earn their loyalty as allies in your campaign\u00a0for [The Carmel Star]. Even a small choice may sway the Academy's and your final fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/2322fa12ae225f7556137e1dfc7eba7f.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2463 Uncover Hidden Truths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special\u00a0ability to rewind time, and head back to the starting point, revisit explored areas, chart new paths to tackle\u00a0temporal riddles, and peel back layers of the Academy\u2019s\u00a0century-spanning grand plan\u00a0and the secrets of Kotama\u2019s\u00a0own origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/54b120011e634f94ed4b86c7154e67d9.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building on a\u00a0classic Metroidvania gameplay\u00a0of &quot;Exploration + Combat,&quot; we fuse anime-style rendering, multi-path exploration, and the innovative Fluid Detonation System for a fresh take on this\u00a0genre:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Vibrant Anime Aesthetics: Gorgeous game rendering\u00a0and 2D dynamic characters\u2019\u00a0illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Intense\u00a0Combat: Fast-paced duels demanding precision, reflexes, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Epic Boss Battles: Uniquely designed challenges that test mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Exploration Rewards: Abundant\u00a0collectibles and upgrades for curious adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Flexible Difficulty: Casual mode or hardcore challenges\u2014play it your way.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kotama&amp;Academy\u00a0Citadel</i></strong> is a 3D Metroidvania game where players embody a mysterious yet charming girl to explore\u00a0the labyrinthine \u201cCarmel Academy Citadel\u201d. Embark on a witty, vibrant, and adrenaline-fueled journey to claim the title of [Carmel Star].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/5760a9bd77dd1ce12c19b3afddb288f4.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/757bdcec9e7b31b373e17c40d24d222c.avif?t=1755498814\" data-has-big width=800 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Carmel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An academy celebrated as the pinnacle of cutting-edge science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; reigns supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Carmel Star], a symbol of ultimate prestige, is the dream every student covets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the centennial celebration approaches, a new [Carmel Star Election] is set to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kotama, an mysterious\u00a0&quot;exchange student&quot; who emerges from obscurity, decides to join the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An academy cloistered from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crises lurking in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did it all begin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is worthy of the crown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/17e4de6e5d06